 rows, no pre-aggregates | max = min               |       0 | t      | sift    | f             | t                | t         | 4
 rows, no pre-aggregates | count distinct          |       0 | t      | sift    | f             | t                | t         | 7
 rows, no pre-aggregates | aggregates not selected |       0 | t      | sift    | f             | t                | t         | 5
 rows, no pre-aggregates | FILTER                  |       0 | t      | sift    | f             | t                | t         | 3
